{"id":"geha_ngt","lemma":"gehängt","pos":"adj","rank":4448,"glosses":["hung","hanged"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7f/De-geh%C3%A4ngt.ogg/De-geh%C3%A4ngt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er hatte es verdient, gehängt zu werden.","en":"He deserved to be hanged.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"deserved"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to become"}]},{"text":"Er wurde wegen Mordes gehängt.","en":"He was hanged for murder.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"for, because of"},{"g":"murder","l":"Mord"},null]},{"text":"Ich möchte lieber gehängt als erschossen werden.","en":"I'd rather be hanged than shot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"to shoot dead","l":"erschießen"},{"g":"to become"}]},{"text":"Ich habe den Kalender an die Wand gehängt.","en":"I've hung the calendar on the wall.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"calendar"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"wall, partition"},null]},{"text":"Warum hast du deine Arbeit an den Nagel gehängt?","en":"Why did you quit your job?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"toil"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"A nail"},null]}]}